Data, results and figures in this repository
============================================

data/
-----
`data/drug-enforcement-0001-of-0001.json.zip` is an unmodified copy of the openFDA
drug enforcement bulk export, a work of the United States federal government and
therefore in the public domain in the United States. No copyright is claimed over
it by the author, and no license is granted or needed.

It is redistributed here deliberately. The export is a snapshot rather than a
history, so re-downloading it on a later date returns a different file and the
numbers reported in the accompanying manuscript would not reproduce. The exact
snapshot the analysis was run on is therefore included, with its SHA-256 recorded
in the README.

